    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A delightful mix of romance and comedy unfolds in the future hospital! The protagonist, 'Byron' (nickname: Byo), decides to check into the best hospital to treat his rare disease. But what awaits him is not just treatment\u2014it's an adventure filled with beautiful nurses and plenty of laughs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 6 hours of comic and heart-racing storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple choices and character-specific storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Korean voice acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2114, on a distant planet called &quot;Smile World&quot; that mirrors Earth's civilization, 'Byron' is a positive and lively young man suffering from a rare disease. After entering university, he starts feeling the limitations of his body and, following advice from his bio-implant, decides to seek treatment at a top-tier hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits him there? A team of charming nurses, of course! The way his hospital life unfolds depends on your choices. Will you create a romantic comedy or something even more unexpected?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check into the hospital now and create your own story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHARACTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561620/extras/8920396ccbdf8d4836cb2e28bafb9058.avif?t=1741757457\" width=641 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>'Yuna'</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Yuna is a newly assigned nurse to the rare disease ward. She may be a bit clumsy, but she's hardworking and will probably dedicate herself fully to your treatment.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561620/extras/5e155c9d697a9e6e3be725636eb0dbc0.avif?t=1741757457\" width=641 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>'Sera'</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sera is a veteran nurse overseeing two rare disease wards. Her personality might seem a bit playful, but she handles her duties as a nurse with precision and perfection. There doesn't seem to be a single flaw in her.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561620/extras/64d8db2d62e646bd048dafcbee31274b.avif?t=1741757457\" width=641 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>'Cure'</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Cure is a second-year nurse in the rare disease ward. She\u2019s cheerful and has the ability to become friends with anyone in no time. Well, at least that's how she seems on the outside.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561620/extras/b92f5ebd9090002a91a87b7daba3cc55.avif?t=1741757457\" width=641 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>'Dami'</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Dami is a patient who is hospitalized in the same ward as the protagonist due to the same illness. She appears to have a blunt and cold personality. Hmm... I wonder if she can become friends with the protagonist.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561620/extras/f7b7b4ac411f4de9afd638eec300737a.avif?t=1741757457\" width=641 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>'Wendi'</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;She is the head nurse who oversees the entire hospital. She is very strict and has the complete trust of the hospital director. To get by in the hospital, you must avoid drawing her attention.&quot;</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A delightful mix of romance and comedy unfolds in the future hospital! The protagonist, 'Byron' (nickname: Byo), decides to check into the best hospital to treat his rare disease. But what awaits him is not just treatment\u2014it's an adventure filled with beautiful nurses and plenty of laughs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 6 hours of comic and heart-racing storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple choices and character-specific storylines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Korean voice acting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the year 2114, on a distant planet called &quot;Smile World&quot; that mirrors Earth's civilization, 'Byron' is a positive and lively young man suffering from a rare disease. After entering university, he starts feeling the limitations of his body and, following advice from his bio-implant, decides to seek treatment at a top-tier hospital.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits him there? A team of charming nurses, of course! The way his hospital life unfolds depends on your choices. Will you create a romantic comedy or something even more unexpected?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check into the hospital now and create your own story!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHARACTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561620/extras/8920396ccbdf8d4836cb2e28bafb9058.avif?t=1741757457\" width=641 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>'Yuna'</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Yuna is a newly assigned nurse to the rare disease ward. She may be a bit clumsy, but she's hardwork