re_item_assets/steam/apps/3561620/extras/f7b7b4ac411f4de9afd638eec300737a.avif?t=1741757457\" width=641 height=405 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>'Wendi'</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;She is the head nurse who oversees the entire hospital. She is very strict and has the complete trust of the hospital director. To get by in the hospital, you must avoid drawing her attention.&quot;</p>",
